763 0 obj
<</ActualText(AI Product Designer and Product Lead with 7+ years in technology, including 6+ years in UX and product design. Focused on Human…AI Interaction, Agentic AI UX, Conversational AI, and AI product strategy for LLM-powered, Generative AI \(GenAI\) products. Ex\
perienced in taking B2B and enterprise SaaS products from early concept to production, translating complex AI agent capabilities into goal-oriented, human-in-the-loop workflows that help people understand, trust, and work effectively with AI.)/K 8/P 734 0 R/Pg 790 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
